OmaSteam is a fork of Metro by Rose (MetroSteam):

  https://github.com/RoseTheFlower/MetroSteam

The CSS, theme.json, skin.json, preview, and decals in this repository
are Rose's work. Upstream published no license file. This fork exists so
Omarchy users can install that skin together with a palette hook, without
installing Metro by Rose from the Millennium theme browser first.

The Omarchy hook and install scripts (omahook-omasteam, install.sh,
uninstall.sh) are original to this fork.

See UPSTREAM.md for Rose's original README and credits.
